--- Major Scale Master ---

This Java tool calculates the full Major Scale and its Diatonic Chords from any given root note.

How it works:
    - Input: Enter any note (e.g., C, F#, Ab).
    - Scale: Calculates the 7 notes based on the W-W-H-W-W-W-H pattern.
    - Chords: Maps each note to its correct chord quality (Major, Minor, or Diminished).

